  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "recordingMethod": "Manually reviewed Chromium 151 CSS-pixel capture of two isolated, source-pinned DOM replays of the checked-in moveCardBundle -> moveCard -> attachCard -> syncRotation -> refreshBoard path. The legacy HTML, CSS, cardback asset, and Trainer-as-Tool category path are loaded or inspected directly; application/network modules remain inert, and their relevant mutation logic is narrowly transcribed. The immediate attach result is diagnostic only. Stable geometry is captured after refresh reconstruction, adjustCards, and empty-wrapper MutationObserver settlement across two animation frames. Painted boxes come from getBoundingClientRect; untransformed layout boxes are measured synchronously with the inline transform suppressed and restored without yielding.",
